# Normalise line endings: LF in the repository and in every working copy.
# Without this, Windows contributors emit CRLF and every touched file shows up as
# fully rewritten in review. Biome formats to LF, so the two must agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# pnpm-lock.yaml is deliberately left as a normal diffable file: on a public
# repository the lockfile diff is the main review surface for supply-chain changes.
